   "source": [
    "We apply the renames to the weekly rows and build the song table again. Two songs, \"Carnival\" and\n",
    "\"Karma\", had been counted as two separate Top 10 hits each, so the Top 10 count goes down by two."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "7e921835",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-19T00:26:33.078206Z",
