   "source": [
    "### Step 11. Album drops and release timing\n",
    "\n",
    "When an artist releases an album, many of its songs can enter the chart in the same week. We count\n",
    "how many songs the lead artist debuted that week and put the count into four groups."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
